{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "be9455aab79657a9ae741f3e6209a632b59db0187c103046b325bb55c36a6c61", "ja": "応援の前に、開場前の最終確認しなきゃ！\nえーっと……。", "zh": "在加油之前，得先做开场前的最后确认！\n呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c49151791ce483d43ebe2a0a20f8f37f0876d0daec8d3cd965328132cb2ebf03", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\n客席の準備が終わりました。受付の方はどうですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n观众席已经准备好了。接待处那边怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "e5fed6bbc1f474f6915749011c0ecd0f61f461c5473aeda4e4183ead68c4fb21", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です。\nはい！　受付の方も準備できてますよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n好的！接待处那边也已经准备好了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4e7379873b68c2c073847ff1df5bf7be9c5de3bbe8b00557c75d65531b5a940a", "ja": "わかりました。\nそれじゃ、ちょっと早いですが社長達を迎えに……。", "zh": "明白了。\n那么，虽然还稍微早了点，但我去接社长他们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1004_president", "source_sha256": "25d3bc36a216f7032de1a8a3a13f444f879a206754b8975cc9964e17dc99140c", "ja": "はっはっはっ！　迎えの必要はないぞ。\n私と音無君なら、ここにいるからな！", "zh": "哈哈哈哈！不用来接我们。  \n我和音无君就在这里呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8207de4971f77a1c23331c9a9e6f8d62fa9327b4d05e40f1ac56e4d45857c8cb", "ja": "わっ！　お疲れ様です！\n早い到着にビックリしました！", "zh": "哇！辛苦了！\n你们到得这么早，吓了我一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "f7aced951e6a7ced038954a0c5ec2dab642ec758042b88b10b686505a460b9a3", "ja": "ですよね。社長、すっごく楽しみにしてたんですよ。\n「早く行こう！」って、朝から何回も言ってて。", "zh": "是吧。社长一直特别期待呢。\n从早上开始就说了好几次“快点出发吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "e1a06fbf5b478c96b8c3ede73b65dfc86299ce09c4d7a7d6550ad6d823387b07", "ja": "{$P$}さんがお迎えにくる前に、\nこうしてやって来たんです。", "zh": "在{$P$}先生来接我们之前，\n他就已经像这样跑过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1008_president", "source_sha256": "1d35e484afa623a3916e520beba30a59511503317e57bd07316cea749fb396dc", "ja": "いや～。応援上映というのは初めての体験でね。\n年甲斐もなくワクワクしているんだ。", "zh": "哎呀～。应援场上映我还是头一回体验呢。\n我都这把年纪了，还兴奋得不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "3350c7451a4bd2caa51ba36d7c4cdfdd34af6354ea77eefd9e95f4db5004957b", "ja": "コンサートライトも、ちゃんと持ってきたよ。\n応援する準備はバッチリだ！", "zh": "演唱会荧光棒也好好带来了。\n加油的准备，万事俱备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "beea12eb87968b6808df76ead6b2cc21ef3d4eb9cc27204e5a8adc00178f52b0", "ja": "わあ～、さすがです！　あっ、お客さん用に応援グッズ\nも用意したので、必要でしたら言ってくださいね！", "zh": "哇～，真不愧是您！啊，我还给客人们准备了\n加油道具，如果有需要的话请随时跟我说哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "62bc2edfe668e60a0d77d78e7884958dd285dc2fcb1a3d240c2f18987d2f9840", "ja": "マラカス、タンバリン、カスタネット！\nいろいろありますよ～♪", "zh": "沙锤、铃鼓、响板！各种各样的都有哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "a5c753ae664c4170f9ebe3c11bc6ec8e39c7eb6f24be515c6bfcab5942f8117b", "ja": "いいアイデアじゃない！　声を出すのが恥ずかしい人も\nこれで楽しめるわね。私も何か借りようかな？", "zh": "这主意不错嘛！即使是不好意思出声的人，也能用这个玩得开心了。我也借点什么来用吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "fc3f63f05f0150962eca67eb411cd1d039cb08b914a5c0f1ba9015f0fc76d96f", "ja": "私も……といきたいところだが、小道具を持つと、\nコンサートライトが持てなくなってしまうような……？", "zh": "我也……本来想这么说的，可是拿着小道具的话，好像就没法拿演唱会荧光棒了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "da380fe11a9e6f1e0fddb89903148437e67f617e7f24e941c93d33ba362bd16d", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、社長！　体を全部使えば、\n20種類はいけますから♪", "zh": "没关系的，社长！只要用上全身，\n拿个20种完全没问题哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "e305f2fe94bdfb649e4e08ecb14703b95cc60ca7433c2f23fd258f22197aa6f1", "ja": "そ、そうなのかい？　むう、音無君はなかなかの\n猛者のようだね。よし、私も借りておくとしよう！", "zh": "啊、原来是这样吗？唔，音无君似乎也是个相当厉害的人呢。好，我也借来用用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4253b70ba9d4d70bd10bb664debdc7e552ecf66f72d57a6f269bc574951f79af", "ja": "青羽さん、ここには俺がいますから、\n社長達の案内をお願いできますか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，这里有我在，能请你带社长他们参观一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "3ac2ef21afbab43f453c436772970fb5d8383fe467bed76c8ab1c36f30b9ee37", "ja": "はい、任せてください！\nそれでは、社長さん、音無先輩！　こちらです！", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！\n那么，社长、音无前辈！这边请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "65b4cc4cd203cf327698ae0f7d4defcab37f82e37f3d720e8a0143ea2ffb38f0", "ja": "青羽さんが戻ってきたら、早速開場かな。\nさて、今日はどんな応援上映になるか楽しみだ！", "zh": "青羽小姐回来后，应该就要马上开场了吧。好了，真期待今天会是怎样的应援放映啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_intro_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "05da4866631fdd55c57c7b05b3ffc1675d8d7c1991a175ad4d5f610cbf82c3c1", "ja": "まもなく、『リリィ・ナイトと天空の騎士団』の\n応援上映を開始いたします。みなさまご着席ください♪", "zh": "《莉莉·奈特与天空骑士团》的应援上映\n马上就要开始了。请各位就座♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
